The portable procedural-layout compatibility stream adapts the Rand project's
PCG seed expansion, ChaCha12 stream and rand 0.8.5 sampling algorithms.
Copyright 2018 Developers of the Rand project.
Copyright (c) 2014 The Rust Project Developers.
Selected license: MIT; full terms are in assets/LICENSE-RAND.txt.
Source: https://github.com/rust-random/rand
Compatibility versions: rand 0.8.5, rand_chacha 0.3.1, rand_core 0.6.4.
No Rand crate is included as a guest dependency. The scalar implementation is
used only to reproduce public level seeds, not for keys or security randomness.

